 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "They look relieved.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "They think they are going for a long walk and then a boat home.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The King does not let tigers walk away because they promise not to bite.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The road is closed.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You are prisoners of the State of Travancore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DONNADI"
   ],
   "text": "We have terms!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "donnadi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DONNADI"
   ],
   "text": "You agreed to let us march to Kanyakumari with our arms!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "donnadi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Terms change when kings have time to think.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You burned our temples. You took our people as slaves. Did you think we would simply wave goodbye?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY (in Dutch)"
   ],
   "text": "<Joseph. Look around you. This is not a battle we can win.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "donnadi",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY (in Dutch)"
   ],
   "text": "<The alternative is worse than surrender.>",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "donnadi",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You have marched out.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Now you will drop the arms.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DONNADI (a short, sharp oath)"
   ],
   "text": "Verdomme.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "donnadi",
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DONNADI (off, cracked balloon)"
   ],
   "text": "Down.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "donnadi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Take them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You move quickly.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "The sea moves quickly. I merely follow its currents.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "There will be salvage. Things that have no flag now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Those belong to the king.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Some do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "For the prisoners. Marthanda Varma will remember who fed his new recruits.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "A man who is remembered kindly by both sides is a man who survives.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Is that all you care about? Surviving?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "I care about this coast. We have seen the Portuguese come and fade. Now the Dutch fade. But the Marakkars remain.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "The sea belongs to no one. It only lends itself to those clever enough to use it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Tell Ramayyan I will have the full inventory of Dutch salvage on his table by nightfall. For the usual consideration, of course.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I will not let the company write a second ending to this battle while my men are drinking water.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Ride. Find what has come out of Kanyakumari and break its teeth. But do not chase it into stone.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "If you are going to ride into trouble, I will be close enough to drag you out.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RUNNER"
   ],
   "text": "Order from the Dalawa. Do not pursue. Not into their guns.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Let them carry the story back.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Today they learned that even the road home has teeth.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "You have a strange way of keeping treaties.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I keep the treaties that benefit my people.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Allowing an enemy army to march to another fort so they can attack me again next year does not benefit anyone but you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Honour...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Honour is eating well and sleeping without fear. Dead men have no honour.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You are alive. That is the only term that matters.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You know guns. You know drill. You know how to build forts that do not burn when a lucky shot hits them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I am a Captain of the Dutch East India Company.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "The Company is a ledger.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "THARAKAN"
   ],
   "text": "And books with too much red ink are burned.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "It has already written you off.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They will count the cost, shake their heads, and hire a new captain.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "What do you want?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I want you to build me an army that fights like yours. But better.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Because it will fight for its own land, not for pepper prices.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "You want me to turn my coat.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I want you to change your master. Serve me. Train my men. Cast cannon for us. Build walls that stand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And if I refuse?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Then you remain in Udayagiri. Not as a guest, but as a prisoner.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You will rot here while the world forgets your name.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "And if I accept?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You keep your sword. You keep your rank. You become the Valiya Kappittan, the Great Captain of my forces.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "You were a mercenary once. Before you were a courtier.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am still a mercenary. I just found a paymaster who offers more than coin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "And does he keep his word?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He kept me alive when others would have hanged me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And he let you live when he could have let the Nair boys spear you on the beach.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "I have men. Donnadi. The others.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They can serve too. Or they can wait. The choice is theirs. But the offer starts with you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "I will not fight against the Dutch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I do not need you to fight them. I need you to make sure I do not have to fight them again.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Or if I do, that they lose even faster.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Then, I accept.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Ram will draw up the papers. You start tomorrow.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "He will be useful.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "He will be a weapon. And like any weapon, we must make sure he points away from us.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "That will be part of your task, Nagoji. You speak his language. You know his kind.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Watch him. Be his friend holding the shield.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Friendship with a man who walked away from his own flag is a complicated thing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Life is complicated. That includes surviving it. The simple things usually end in funerals.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "They expect me to dress as one of them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They expect you to stop dressing as their enemy.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Men who lost brothers at Colachel will not take orders from a man who wears the uniform that killed them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "I have worn this since I was seventeen. My mother sewed the lining herself before I left Arras for the sea.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Your mother is in Arras. You are in Travancore.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The coat cannot follow you where you are going.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Show me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY (inset, a short hot oath in Flemish, lettered untranslated)"
   ],
   "text": "Nondedju.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Do I look ridiculous?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You look like a man who has not yet learned to stand in his new clothes. That will change.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The cloth is easy.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The hard part is when you give your first order and a Nair captain looks at your pale face and wonders why he should obey.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "What do I do then?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You show him something he respects. Not your old rank. Not your old flag.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Competence. Fairness. The willingness to stand in the same sun and eat the same rice.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DE LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "The rice is going to take some getting used to.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "So is everything else. Welcome to Travancore, Kappittan.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  }
 ]
}